00000000                             2  *-----------------------------------------------------------
00000000                             3  * Title      : ZOMBIE SPLATTER
00000000                             4  * Written by : Josh Tobin
00000000                             5  * Date       : 06/03/2026
00000000                             6  * Description: ZOMBIE SPLATTER is a 2D side scrolling game where zombies move 
00000000                             7  * across the screen from right to left. The player must react 
00000000                             8  * quickly to avoide the large zombies before they damage your hull integrity.
00000000                             9  * The player must kill small zombies to increas the kill counter to get as many 
00000000                            10  * kills as possible. The player must be careful as fuel is quickly running out,
00000000                            11  * so the player must pick up fuel drops that spawn on the screen.
00000000                            12  * If you your fuel goes to zero or your hull integrity goes to zero you lose.
00000000                            13  *
00000000                            14  *
00000000                            15  * This program handles the movement and resetting of zombies, 
00000000                            16  * ensuring that when a zombie moves off the right side of the 
00000000                            17  * screen, it respawns at their assigned X and Y coordinates.
00000000                            18  * small and large zombies have separate reset routines to 
00000000                            19  * manage their positions and activity.
00000000                            20  * 
00000000                            21  * This program also handles many collision factors between
00000000                            22  * the player and the objects in its path, all occur and result
00000000                            23  * in differnt ways. 
00000000                            24  *-----------------------------------------------------------
