000011DC                           263  * Subroutine    : Game
000011DC                           264  * Description   : Game including main GameLoop. GameLoop is like
000011DC                           265  * a while loop in that it runs forever until interupted
000011DC                           266  * (Input, Update, Draw). The Enemies Run at Player Jump to Avoid
000011DC                           267  *-----------------------------------------------------------
000011DC                           268  GAME:
000011DC  6100 033A                269      BSR     PLAY_RUN                ; Play Run Wav
000011E0  6100 0390                270      BSR     PLAY_BACKGROUND
000011E4                           271  GAMELOOP:
